        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                "word": "microcosme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5414f0ba-4415-439e-9944-5e4af1c54ea1",
                        "entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "microcosmes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d294f149-c40c-3085-b897-74190ac994ab",
                        "entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Monde en petit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Philosophie ancienne"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "217c52ba-a87a-4f61-9fcc-0b6f73851a91",
                                "sense_id": "d294f149-c40c-3085-b897-74190ac994ab",
                                "text": "La moniale bénédictine Hildegarde von Bingen décrivit une cosmologie des affections des plantes qui attribue essentiellement aux vapeurs toxiques du macrocosme les dégâts observés dans les champs du microcosme."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f09caf9b-dc76-36dd-9aa8-2306742e1f02",
                        "entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Milieu de petite envergure constituant un monde en soi, distinct du reste du monde."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4dc1c29-74ff-426f-9ac5-bbb2190055e9",
                                "sense_id": "f09caf9b-dc76-36dd-9aa8-2306742e1f02",
                                "text": "Car je n'avais pas oublié les leçons qu'on peut trouver dans ce véritable microcosme qu'on appelle un couvent. Un monde en petit demeure un monde entier, multiple et varié."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db2591eb-6496-4afd-ace4-5fcb19441865",
                                "sense_id": "f09caf9b-dc76-36dd-9aa8-2306742e1f02",
                                "text": "De façon plus large, on peut constater que le microcosme médiatique québécois accorde, depuis quelques années, une place grandissante à l'opinion, au détriment de la réflexion et de l'analyse critique fondée sur la raison."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "54085b14-b0d0-3fcc-9e03-899630df5f19",
                        "entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Milieu social replié sur lui-même."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38ab9f79-44d1-4de6-9b3a-50f68ec9e156",
                                "sense_id": "54085b14-b0d0-3fcc-9e03-899630df5f19",
                                "text": "Il n’intervient pas dans l’« affaire Barroso », qui scandalise le microcosme bruxellois et donne des munitions aux antieuropéens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40cd607e-c03f-4752-89e7-097c744074fd",
                                "sense_id": "54085b14-b0d0-3fcc-9e03-899630df5f19",
                                "text": "Lupita était arrivée enfant à Hallow dans les années 1960 et avait grandi à Little Italy, là où tout le monde semble ignorer qu’on ne se trouve pas réellement en Italie. […] C’est un vrai microcosme, et Lupita avait été élevée selon les traditions de son pays."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8fff651d-6c08-371e-a0f2-a8d4ccb6dbad",
                        "entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ascidie à peau violette, comestible, de la Méditerranée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ffa1e3b6-2125-4dd4-a253-423e8b5c0091",
                        "source_entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Mikrokosmos",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mikrokosmos",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "76346100-4e7e-3adc-b4b6-c3fe92b30579",
                                        "entry_id": "593d7e78-ee03-3c35-8504-e07fcdf33f5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "der Bereich der kleinen und kleinsten Dimensionen des Kosmos, den der Mensch sich nur mit Hilfsmitteln indirekt erschließen kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "physics"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d42c3f01-2179-34ed-8f84-369c28e1dca0",
                                        "entry_id": "593d7e78-ee03-3c35-8504-e07fcdf33f5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "die Gesamtheit aller Kleinlebewesen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8c2edc8-31d7-3a30-b1f1-40c449125fd5",
                                        "entry_id": "593d7e78-ee03-3c35-8504-e07fcdf33f5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kleine Teilwelt der menschlichen Kultur, die ein verkleinertes Abbild des Universums darstellt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "403f5a7f-f29a-408c-b7bc-6f82d6bf0b1c",
                                                "sense_id": "c8c2edc8-31d7-3a30-b1f1-40c449125fd5",
                                                "text": "„Bereits Robert Fludd hatte den Zusammenhang von Mikrokosmos und Makrokosmos gelehrt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5af5066-63f3-4327-8833-fc2f772e62e9",
                                                "sense_id": "c8c2edc8-31d7-3a30-b1f1-40c449125fd5",
                                                "text": "„Den Dienstsitz, das nahe der Place de l'Étoile gelegene Luxushotel »Majetic«, erlebt er als Mikrokosmos des okkupierten Landes – und somit als idealen Beobachtungsstandpunkt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb2e05a7-9695-4416-9e36-8bec8a702a01",
                                                "sense_id": "c8c2edc8-31d7-3a30-b1f1-40c449125fd5",
                                                "text": "„Wagner widmet sich auch dem Interieur und erschließt über Räumlichkeiten und Ausstattung den Mikrokosmos ostpreußischer Gutshauskultur.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ebb691be-a2b0-456b-b57a-f948b6e4a312",
                        "source_entry_id": "21ef3fe4-4158-3e3d-94be-3e2a205f477c",
                        "target_lang_word": "microcosm",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "microcosm",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "589eed4e-b133-3181-b12c-2c57c360fa26",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8e8765-c265-37ac-94cd-59cc2dfbb43d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Human nature or the human body as representative of the wider universe; man considered as a miniature counterpart of divine or universal nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "895f528a-84cb-444b-a5f9-d09e9caff727",
                                                "sense_id": "589eed4e-b133-3181-b12c-2c57c360fa26",
                                                "text": "The Christian humanists were emphatic in their demand that a man who wishes to understand himself must realize that he is a little world that reflects on a smaller scale the larger world of the universe. […] On the other hand, the whole idea of man as a microcosm was questioned by those who were not in sympathy with the Christian humanists."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd98a1b7-263c-3151-84d6-94ee098f291f",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8e8765-c265-37ac-94cd-59cc2dfbb43d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The human body; a person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d6d8f91-2daa-44e2-80d2-d3bf4568f81e",
                                                "sense_id": "bd98a1b7-263c-3151-84d6-94ee098f291f",
                                                "text": "If you see this in the Map of my Microcosme, followes it that I am knowne well enough too?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ace65bb-1a92-3ae4-b64d-0eb08133bd28",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8e8765-c265-37ac-94cd-59cc2dfbb43d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A smaller system which is seen as representative of a larger one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39e3d3eb-387e-4e96-9bde-d6dd1f8d3765",
                                                "sense_id": "9ace65bb-1a92-3ae4-b64d-0eb08133bd28",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: epitome, paradigm, model"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "469fc4de-45f5-4f2c-8e76-565921fd7f21",
                                                "sense_id": "9ace65bb-1a92-3ae4-b64d-0eb08133bd28",
                                                "text": "That short journey to Brighton was like a microcosm of the railway universe, embracing as it did a tunnel, a viaduct, two junctions, and two termini! Unfortunately, the route was far from direct."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a61f9e9-7f35-4513-a2ff-b62c0d731cf3",
                                                "sense_id": "9ace65bb-1a92-3ae4-b64d-0eb08133bd28",
                                                "text": "‘In a sense, the problems experienced at Bristol are like a microcosm of what is happening in the NHS - experienced surgeons battling against difficult circumstances, with inadequate resources and in a culture where the finding of scapegoats appears to be put before the finding of solutions.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed5c9f4b-d8cb-4400-8a2a-f9444e89323a",
                                                "sense_id": "9ace65bb-1a92-3ae4-b64d-0eb08133bd28",
                                                "text": "Steve Bruce's side have swung from highs to lows in what has been at best a wildly inconsistent start to the season. They experienced a microcosm of this within the opening 45 minutes at the Stadium of Light."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0e172c5-17f1-4352-a23c-62f6964e5e04",
                                                "sense_id": "9ace65bb-1a92-3ae4-b64d-0eb08133bd28",
                                                "text": "It should come as no surprise to see promotional material and bulletin boards in the department’s languages, though English is also present in the signage of this microcosm of the institution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aae8abf-d151-4a10-baa3-8836c953a6cf",
                                                "sense_id": "9ace65bb-1a92-3ae4-b64d-0eb08133bd28",
                                                "text": "The wider North West and Central Region is itself a microcosm of the industry's complexity. Covering the approaches to London Euston, stretching through Birmingham and the West Midlands, and reaching Manchester, Liverpool and beyond, it is a patchwork of overlapping markets, political geographies, and infrastructure types."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5224ee17-3196-39bb-909a-9ab7a2982db1",
                                        "entry_id": "9e8e8765-c265-37ac-94cd-59cc2dfbb43d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small natural ecosystem; an artificial ecosystem set up as an experimental model."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1b9617b-657b-4fee-b3ea-3acf9b6471b5",
                                                "sense_id": "5224ee17-3196-39bb-909a-9ab7a2982db1",
                                                "text": "The method is relatively labour intensive (24-30 microcosms are run) and more difficult to interpret when compared with other microcosm methods (Shannon et al. 1986; Cairns & Cherry 1993)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
